			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate submodule updates across Cocoon, Maintain, and Mountain\n\nSynchronize all three Element submodules to their latest state:\n- Cocoon: Add bidirectional language provider sync with Mountain — registers all language provider events (hover, completion, definition, references, code actions, document symbols, formatting) with Mountain, forwards executeCommand when no local handler exists, and implements document content cache mirroring open documents with $acceptModelChanged/$acceptModelOpen/$acceptModelClose notifications. LoadContent now prefers cached content over disk reads.\n- Maintain: Update Documentation/Rust submodule pointer to latest commit.\n- Mountain: Implement 18 language feature provider delegations in CocoonService — replace TODO stubs with actual implementations that extract request parameters, convert to DTOs, and invoke environment methods. Enables VS Code language extensions to provide full language server functionality through the gRPC bridge.",
			"SHA": "b74c6380bf6610fd57e5022dac0669c71c310d82"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:24:34Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⡏⠀⠀",
				28,
				15
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate submodule updates across all Elements\n\nMajor themes in this update:\n\n1. **DevLog Logging System** (Air, Grove, Mountain): Introduce custom tag-filtered dev_log! macro replacing log/tracing crates. Controlled by LAND_DEV_LOG env var with per-tag filtering, short mode for compressed output, and OTLP span emission for Jaeger/OpenTelemetry.\n\n2. **Extension Host Protocol** (Mountain, Sky, Wind): Complete Wind→Mountain→Cocoon message relay path with fire-and-forget gRPC forwarding. Add 5-retry polling for extension scanning in Sky with VSCodeNodeModules fallback. Enhance Wind debugging with granular init marks and RPC message logging.\n\n3. **VS Code Bundling** (Output): Add ESBuild config for bundling VS Code in Tauri environment with full browser polyfills (ChildProcess, FileSystem, IPC, Process, etc.) and Tauri IPC channel stubs.\n\n4. **Dependency Updates**: Bump actions/cache (Air, Echo, Mountain, Rest, SideCar), wrangler/miniflare/workers-types (Echo), sinon (Output), upload-artifact (Output).\n\n5. **Documentation Fixes**: Fix README links in Mist, SideCar, Vine, Worker. Update Documentation/Rust submodule in Common and Echo.\n\n6. **Misc Fixes**: Cocoon removes .js extensions for ESM best practices. Vine corrects GitHub URLs. Mountain fixes node_modules path and IPv4/IPv6 binding.\n\nThis synchronizes all Element submodules to their latest state, enabling the DevLog centralized logging infrastructure and completing the extension host IPC path.",
